  ('revised-k10-grade-10-mathematics:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-10-mathematics', 3, 'D02', 'performance', 'transform the equation of a circle from center-radius form to general form, and vice versa, and determine the center and radius from a given equation. (NA)', 1, 67),
