  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Mixtures and the products of their separation techniques are very useful in our daily lives.', 3, 41),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Scientific investigations need to satisfy the features of a fair test and use accurate and reliable measurements.', 4, 41),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 1, 'D01', 'performance', 'By the end of the Quarter, learners demonstrate an understanding of the benefits of various separation techniques. They use diagrams and flowcharts to describe changes of state. They use the words reversible and irreversible to describe changes to materials. They demonstrate skills in the use of equipment. They recognize and apply their understanding of the features of a fair test.', 1, 41),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 2, 'D02', 'content', 'Animals have systems that help them grow, respond, and reproduce.', 1, 42),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-2:item-2', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 2, 'D02', 'content', 'There are several modes of reproduction in plants.', 2, 42),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-2:item-3', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 2, 'D02', 'content', 'To be valid and reliable, scientific investigations need to include fair tests and multiple trials.', 3, 42),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-2:item-4', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 2, 'D02', 'content', 'Animals can be grouped as vertebrates or invertebrates based on their characteristics.', 4, 42),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-2:item-5', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 2, 'D02', 'content', 'Producers, consumers, scavengers, and decomposers have important roles in food webs.', 5, 42),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-2:item-6', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 2, 'D02', 'content', 'Interactions within an ecosystem can have important impacts on the living things within it.', 6, 42),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 2, 'D02', 'performance', 'By the end of the Quarter, learners demonstrate an understanding of the different ways that plants reproduce. Plan a simple scientific investigation to determine which method works best in a given habitat. They describe and provide examples of vertebrates as animals with a backbone and invertebrates as animals that do not have a backbone. They design an example of a food web showing the role of consumers, producers, scavengers, and decomposers. They identify the technical terms biotic and abiotic as referring to living and non-living things.', 1, 42),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 3, 'D03', 'content', 'Simple machines allow people to change the direction and size of forces.', 1, 43),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-3:item-2', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 3, 'D03', 'content', 'Waves transfer energy between source and receiver.', 2, 43),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-3:item-3', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 3, 'D03', 'content', 'Science processes and concepts help solve everyday problems.', 3, 43),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 3, 'D03', 'performance', 'By the end of the Quarter, learners demonstrate objective inquiry by carrying out investigations to critically observe patterns and systems scientifically. They support their observations and conclusions using secondary sources to explain occurrences and concepts using technical scientific language. They use critical thinking skills and creativity to make models and other devices to communicate their understanding to other people.', 1, 43),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 4, 'D04', 'content', 'Volcanoes are vents from which molten rock from Earth’s crust erupts onto the surface releasing pressure and gases.', 1, 44),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-4:item-2', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 4, 'D04', 'content', 'The Philippine volcanoes can violently and unpredictably erupt lava, ash, and ballistic projectiles.', 2, 44),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-4:item-3', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 4, 'D04', 'content', 'Weather and climate have predictable patterns throughout the year, which affect human activities.', 3, 44),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-4:item-4', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 4, 'D04', 'content', 'The revolution and the rotation of the Earth demonstrate observable patterns.', 4, 44),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:content:period-4:item-5', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 4, 'D04', 'content', 'Constellations are patterns of stars in the sky.', 5, 44),
  ('revised-k10-grade-6-science:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-6-science', 4, 'D04', 'performance', 'By the end of the Quarter, learners appreciate that volcanoes can have unexpected and severe impacts on communities and that the uncertainty and impacts of unpredicted eruptions can be offset by understanding and following alerts from authorities. Learners appreciate weather patterns that produce seasons that are largely predictable, and they use models to scientifically understand and describe natural processes and timing that can be relied upon, such as the changes of season. Learners identify that scientific models are valuable in explaining other observations of patterns in nature, such as the apparent movement of celestial objects across the sky. They exhibit respect for cultures and interpretations of natural phenomena by indigenous people over generations and balance that with respect for explaining phenomena using scientific inquiry and objectivity.', 1, 44),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-english:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-english', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate their multiliteracies and communicative competence in evaluating Philippine literature (poetry) for clarity of meaning, purpose, and target audience as a foundation for publishing original literary texts that reflect local and national identity.', 1, 144),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-english:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-english', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners analyze the style, form, and features of Philippine poetry (lyric, narrative, dramatic); evaluate poetry for clarity of meaning, purpose, and target audience; and compose and publish an original multimodal literary text (poem) that represents their meaning, purpose, and target audience, and reflects their local and national identity.', 1, 144),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-english:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-english', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate their multiliteracies and communicative competence in evaluating Philippine literature (prose) for clarity of meaning, purpose, and target audience as a foundation for publishing original literary texts that reflect local and national identity.', 1, 146),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-english:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-english', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners analyze the style, form, and features of Philippine prose (short story and novel); evaluate prose for clarity of meaning, purpose, and target audience; and compose and publish an original multimodal literary text (short story) that represents their meaning, purpose, and target audience, and reflects their local and national identity.', 1, 146),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-english:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-english', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate their multiliteracies and communicative competence in evaluating informational texts (expository texts and journalistic texts: news and press releases, and features) for clarity of meaning, purpose, and target audience as a foundation for publishing original informational texts.', 1, 148),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-english:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-english', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners analyze the style, form, and features of informational texts (expository texts, news and press releases, and features); evaluate informational texts for clarity of meaning, purpose, and target audience; and compose and publish original multimodal informational texts (expository texts, news and press releases, and features) using appropriate forms and structures that represent their meaning, purpose, and target audience.', 1, 148),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-english:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-english', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate their multiliteracies and communicative competence in evaluating informational texts (academic text: expository essays) and transactional texts (letter of request) for clarity of meaning, purpose, and target audience as a foundation for publishing original informational and transactional texts.', 1, 151),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-english:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-english', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners analyze the style, form, and features of informational texts (expository essays) and transactional texts (letter of request); evaluate informational and transactional texts for clarity of meaning, purpose, and target audience; and compose and publish original multimodal informational texts (expository essays) and transactional texts (letter of request) using appropriate forms and structures that represent their meaning, purpose, and target audience.', 1, 151),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-filipino:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-filipino', 1, null, 'content', 'Naipamamalas ng mga mag-aaral ang kasanayang komunikatibo, pagiging malikhain, at kritikal na pag-unawa at pagsusuri ng mga tekstong pampanitikan sa Panahon ng Katutubo (Tula) at tekstong impormasyonal (ekspositori) para sa paghubog ng kaakuhan at pagpapahalagang Pilipino, at pagbuo ng mga teksto sa iba’t ibang paraan (multimodal) para sa tiyak na layunin, pagpapakahulugan, at target na babasa o awdiyens.', 1, 122),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-filipino:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-filipino', 1, null, 'performance', 'Nakabubuo ng sanaysay tungkol sa pinakatampok na mga pangyayari sa buhay ng isang tauhan sa binasang akda at borador ng comic book brochure na isinasaalang-alang ang mga elemento ng biswal at multimodal na may paglalapat ng kasanayang komunikatibo, at etikal na kasanayan at pananagutan.', 1, 122),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-filipino:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-filipino', 2, null, 'content', 'Naipamamalas ng mga mag-aaral ang kasanayang komunikatibo, pagiging malikhain, at kritikal na pag-unawa at pagsusuri ng mga tekstong pampanitikan sa Panahon ng Katutubo (Tuluyan) at tekstong impormasyonal (ekspositori) para sa paghubog ng kaakuhan at pagpapahalagang Pilipino, at pagbuo ng mga teksto sa iba’t ibang paraan (multimodal) para sa tiyak na layunin, pagpapakahulugan, at target na babasa o awdiyens.', 1, 125),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-filipino:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-filipino', 2, null, 'performance', 'Nakabubuo ng sanaysay tungkol sa pinakatampok na mga pangyayari sa buhay ng isang tauhan sa binasang akda at disenyo ng comic book brochure na isinasaalang-alang ang mga elemento ng biswal at multimodal na may paglalapat ng kasanayang komunikatibo, at etikal na kasanayan at pananagutan', 1, 125),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-filipino:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-filipino', 3, null, 'content', 'Naipamamalas ng mga mag-aaral ang kasanayang komunikatibo, pagiging malikhain, at kritikal na pag-unawa at pagsusuri ng mga tekstong pampanitikan sa Panahon ng Pananakop ng Espanya, tekstong impormasyonal (ekspositori) at balita para sa paghubog ng kaakuhan at pagpapahalagang Pilipino, at pagbuo ng mga teksto sa iba’t ibang paraan (multimodal) para sa tiyak na layunin, pagpapakahulugan, at target na babasa o awdiyens.', 1, 128),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-filipino:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-filipino', 3, null, 'performance', 'Nakabubuo ng sanaysay tungkol sa pinakatampok na mga pangyayari sa buhay ng isang tauhan sa binasang akda sa pamamagitan ng pinal na comic book brochure na isinasaalang-alang ang mga elemento ng biswal at multimodal na may paglalapat ng kasanayang komunikatibo, at etikal na kasanayan at pananagutan', 1, 128),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-filipino:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-filipino', 4, null, 'content', 'Naipamamalas ng mga mag-aaral ang kasanayang komunikatibo, pagiging malikhain, at kritikal na pag-unawa at pagsusuri ng Obra Maestra – Ibong Adarna para sa paghubog ng kaakuhan at pagpapahalagang Pilipino, at pagbuo ng mga teksto sa iba’t ibang paraan (multimodal) para sa tiyak na layunin, pagpapakahulugan, at target na babasa o awdiyens.', 1, 131),
  ('revised-k10-grade-7-filipino:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'revised-k10-grade-7-filipino', 4, null, 'performance', 'Nakabubuo ng iskrip para sa shadow play tungkol sa mahahalagang pangyayari sa Ibong Adarna na maiuugnay sa pagiging Pilipino na isinasaalang-alang ang mga elemento ng biswal at multimodal na may paglalapat ng kasanayang komunikatibo at etikal na kasanayan at pananagutan.', 1, 131),
