  ('revised-k10-grade-7-mathematics:standard:performance:period-2:item-3', 'revised-k10-grade-7-mathematics', 2, 'D01', 'performance', 'find the volume of square and rectangular pyramids, and the volume of cylinders. (MG)', 3, 53),
