  ('revised-k10-grade-8-mathematics:standard:performance:period-4:item-3', 'revised-k10-grade-8-mathematics', 4, 'D04', 'performance', 'determine the number of possible outcomes of an experiment using the Fundamental Counting Principle. (DP)', 3, 59),
