  ('sshs-grade-11-kitchen-operations:standard:performance:period-4:item-3', 'sshs-grade-11-kitchen-operations', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners collaborate to organize and manage a kitchenpreneur bazaar.', 3, 10),
  ('sshs-grade-11-leadership-and-management-in-the-arts:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-leadership-and-management-in-the-arts', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the fundamental concepts, processes, and contextual factors in production and events management, including planning, organization, resource allocation, and evaluation in artistic productions.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-leadership-and-management-in-the-arts:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-leadership-and-management-in-the-arts', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners develop a production management plan that integrates strategic planning, resource coordination, and evaluation to ensure the effective execution of an artistic production or event.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-leadership-and-management-in-the-arts:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-leadership-and-management-in-the-arts', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the principles and processes of production and events management, including team organization, resource allocation, execution, and evaluation.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-leadership-and-management-in-the-arts:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-leadership-and-management-in-the-arts', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners implement the production management plan by applying management skills and techniques to execute the production and assess its effectiveness based on set objectives and documented progress.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the interconnectedness of developmental tasks, protective and risk factors, sense of self, and health and wellness in their transition from late adolescence to early adulthood.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners reflect on their personal experiences as adolescents in terms of developmental tasks, protective and risk factors, sense of self, and health and wellness.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the value of interpersonal effectiveness in achieving social competence.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners engage in collaborative work that showcases interpersonal effectiveness.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners value the importance of career planning based on the understanding of the different factors affecting the development of career competence.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners design a career action plan aligned to their personal values, interests, skills, and workplace aspirations.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the opportunities, procedures, and strategies in preparation for a future career.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-life-and-career-skills', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners create a portfolio that showcases personal agency and career readiness.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 1, null, 'content', 'Naipamamalas ng mga mag-aaral ang mabisang komunikasyon sa personal at interpersonal na konteksto sa anyong pasalita, pasulat, at multimodal; nauunawaan nilang ang mga padron ng interaksyon ay naiaangkop at kolaboratibo; at ang pagkakaroon ng tiwala, emosyonal na pagtugon, at pag-unawa sa konteksto ay nagpapalalim ng makakabuluhang ugnayan at pakikipagpalagayang-loob sa malalim na pag-unawa sa pinanggagalingan ng kausap.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 1, null, 'performance', 'Nagagampanan ng mga mag-aaral ang mga tiyak na papel sa mga kontrolado at di-kontroladong personal at interpersonal na sitwasyong komunikatibo; nakalalahok sa komunikasyong intrapersonal, gaya ng pagtatakda ng layunin, pagninilay, at pagsusulat sa talaarawan; nakikibahagi sa malalalim na talakayan tungkol sa mga personal at interpersonal na paksa; nakapagbibigay ng maiikli at mahahabang tugon sa mga tanong kaugnay sa nilalaman at layunin ng usapan at korespondensiya; at nakabubuo ng iba’t ibang anyo ng personal at interpersonal na korespondensiya tulad ng liham, email, text message o chat, at post sa social media.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 1, null, 'performance', 'Pagpapakilala ng sarili at pagpapakilala ng ibang tao sa iba’t ibang uri ng tagpuan (pormal/impormal, online/offline)', 2, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 1, null, 'performance', 'Pagbibigay ng makabuluhang mensahe sa iba’t ibang okasyon', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 1, null, 'performance', 'Pagpapahayag ng saloobin o nararamdaman nang may pagsasaalang-alang sa damdamin ng iba • Pakikipag-usap nang “puso sa puso” • Pakikilahok sa mga usapang nangangailangan ng aktibong pakikinig at pagkakaroon ng empatiya (hal., pakikiramay at pakikidalamhati, pagbibigay ng eulohiya, atbp.) • Pagsulat ng personal na liham para sa magulang, kaibigan, kamag-anak, at guro gamit ang email • Pagsulat ng Liham-Pakikidalamhati • Pagsulat ng Liham-Pakikiramay • Pagsulat ng dyornal (travel, personal, at repleksiyon) tungkol sa mga pangyayari sa buhay • Pagsulat ng naganap o hinaing tungkol sa di magandang karanasan • Pagsulat ng blotter ng pagrereklamo sa barangay o tanggapan ng pulisya tungkol sa pang-aabusong naganap at personal na hinaing o kaso (Tematikong pagsasalaysay ng mga pangyayari) • Pagsulat ng mga mensahe sa text, email o pahayag na sulat-kamay para sa layuning personal • Pagpapahayag nang angkop ng mga damdamin at papuri • Paglutas sa mga di-pagkakasundo sa pamamagitan ng magalang na pakikipag-usap • Paglikha ng mga digital diary o vlog na nagpapahayag ng mga pansariling karanasan (hal. reels, blogs, vlogs, memes, video diaries, atbp.) • Paggamit ng multimedia sa online conversations mga usapang online (hal., voice notes, GIFs, images, atbp.)', 4, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 2, null, 'content', 'Naipamamalas ng mga mag-aaral ang mabisang komunikasyon sa mga kontekstong sosyal at kultural sa anyong pasalita, pasulat, at multimodal; nauunawaan nilang ang mga padron ng interaksyon ay sumasalamin sa gampaning panlipunan, mga panlipunang pamantayan at dinamika, at kultural na pagkakaiba-iba, at ang pagiging bukas, pagkakaroon ng sensibilidad sa kultura, paggamit ng ingklusibong wika, at mga etikal na konsiderasyon ay nagpapalalim ng pakikipag-ugnayan sa iba’t ibang komunidad at pampubliko at dihital na espasyo.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 2, null, 'performance', 'Nakikilahok ang mga mag-aaral sa mga sitwasyong komunikatibo na kinabibilangan ng iba’t ibang pangkat sosyal at kultural; nakikibahagi sa mga pormal at di-pormal na ugnayan na nagpapakita ng sensibilidad sa mga pamantayang kultural, panlipunang gampanin at gawi; tumutugon nang may paggalang sa mga pampublikong talakayan hinggil sa mga isyung panlipunan at kultural; at nakabubuo ng mga tekstong pasalita, pasulat, at multimodal gaya ng anunsiyo, opinyon o kolum, naratibong kultural, blogs, at mapagnilay na komentaryong nagtataguyod ng ingklusibo at etikal na komunikasyong panlipunan.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 3, null, 'content', 'Naipamamalas ng mga mag-aaral ang mabisang komunikasyon sa mga akademiko at pampagsasanay na konteksto sa anyong pasalita, pasulat, at multimodal; nauunawaan nila na ang mga padron ng interaksyon sa ganitong konteksto ay pormal, may estruktura, at batay sa partikular na disiplina, at na ang integridad sa intelektuwal na gawain, tapat at magalang na pagpuna, at ingklusibong wika ay nagpapalalim ng makabuluhang pakikilahok sa mga akademiko at pampagsasanay na konteksto.', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 3, null, 'performance', 'Nakabubuo ang mga mag-aaral ng mga akademiko at teknikal na tekstong pasalita, pasulat, at multimodal para sa tiyak na layon at awdyens, gaya ng artikulo, ulat-pananaliksik, presentasyon, rebyu, at podcast; nakapaghahanda ng mga tala at listahan ng mapagkakatiwalaang sanggunian bilang batayan ng mga tekstong ito; nailalapat ang mga tekstong ito sa anyong presentasyon na ginagamitan ng di-berbal na komunikasyon at multimedia; at nakapagbibigay ng tugon at nakatatanggap ng puna hinggil sa nilalaman, estruktura, at wika upang mapaunlad ang pagganap.', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-3:item-2', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 3, null, 'performance', 'Pakikilahok sa mga nakaestrukturang talakayang pangklase o seminar', 2, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-3:item-3', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 3, null, 'performance', 'Pagtatanong/pagmumungkahi', 3, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-3:item-4', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 3, null, 'performance', 'Pakikilahok sa mga debateng akademiko o talakayang panel', 4, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-3:item-5', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 3, null, 'performance', 'Paglalahad ng mga resulta ng saliksik o imbestigatibong ulat sa pulong o kumperensiya', 5, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-3:item-6', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 3, null, 'performance', 'Pagbuo ng kagamitang biswal katulad ng dayagram, tsart, at iba pa sa paglalahad ng kaalaman', 6, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-3:item-7', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 3, null, 'performance', 'Pagsulat ng mga replektibong sanaysay, posisyong papel, o kritisismo', 7, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-3:item-8', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 3, null, 'performance', 'Paggawa ng mga akademikong lagom, abstrak, o reaksiyong papel', 8, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-3:item-9', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 3, null, 'performance', 'Pakikipagkolaborasyon para sa mga pangkatang pagtatanghal o workshop na may feedback', 9, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-3:item-10', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 3, null, 'performance', 'Pagrerekord ng naka-videong sanaysay o pasalitang pagtatanggol ng mga proyekto o tesis', 10, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-3:item-11', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 3, null, 'performance', 'Pagbuo ng teksto gamit ng podcasts, infographics, o digital newsletters Pagbibigay-kahulugan sa mga akademiko at teknikal na tekstong pasalita, pasulat, at multimodal at kung paano ito hinuhubog ng awdyens, layon, at konteksto Naipamamalas ng mga mag-aaral ang kasanayan sa mabisang komunikasyon sa mga propesyonal at pantrabahong konteksto sa anyong pasalita, pasulat, at multimodal; nauunawaan nila na ang mga padron ng interaksyon ay batay sa konteksto at layon, at maikli; at na ang kalinawan, pormalidad, kaalaman sa hirarkiya, regulasyon ng emosyon, kultural na sensibilidad, at etikal na pananagutan ay nagpapalalim ng mabisang propesyonal at pantrabahong ugnayan. Nakabubuo ang mga mag-aaral ng iba’t ibang uri ng korespondensiya alinsunod sa mga kumbensiyon sa pagsulat; nakagagawa ng mga propesyonal na profiles at resumés na akma sa layon at awdyens; nakasusulat ng mga case studies, panukalang proyekto, at ulat-pangnegosyo; nakapagmumungkahi ng mga lathalang pantrabaho, publikasyong korporatibo, o artikulo para sa industriya alinsunod sa pagkakakilanlan ng organisasyon; at nakikilahok sa makabuluhang mga panayam, pulong, talakayan, at negosasyon. • Pagsulat ng nakaestrukturang mga résumé, cover letter, at liham-aplikasyon para sa trabaho o iskolarsyip • Pagsulat ng Korespondensiya Opisyal para sa iba’t ibang pangangailangan (hal., liham-pagtatanong, liham-kahilingan, liham-pagtanggi, liham-pag-uulat, liham-pagsubaybay, liham-panawagan, liham-pagpapatunay, liham-pakikiramay, liham-pakikidalamhati, atbp.) • Pagsulat ng panawagan o anunsiyong pampubliko • Pagbuo ng personal na profile (hal. LinkedIn, portfolio, at iba pang plataporma para sa propesyonal na networking ) • Pagsasanay para sa interbyu sa trabaho, paglalahad ng ideang pangnegosyo, o pakikipagnetwork • Pagsulat ng mga memo, incident report, o katitikan ng pulong • Pagsulat ng email para sa mga pormal na kahilingan, follow-up, at korespondensiya sa ibang opisina • Pagsasadula ng konsultasyon sa mga kliyente, pagsagot sa tawag ng kliyente, o propesyonal na pagpapakilala • Presentasyong pang-multimedia gamit ang mga propesyonal na app (hal., Canva, Powerpoint, atbp.) • Pagtugon sa feedback o reklamo ng mga kustomer gamit ang pasalita at pasulat na komunikasyon', 11, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 4, null, 'content', 'Naipamamalas ng mga mag-aaral ang kasanayan sa mabisang komunikasyon sa mga propesyonal at pantrabahong konteksto sa anyong pasalita, pasulat, at multimodal; nauunawaan nila na ang mga padron ng interaksyon ay batay sa konteksto at layon, at maikli; at na ang kalinawan, pormalidad, kaalaman sa hirarkiya, regulasyon ng emosyon, kultural na sensibilidad, at etikal na pananagutan ay nagpapalalim ng mabisang propesyonal at pantrabahong ugnayan.', 1, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 4, null, 'performance', 'Nakabubuo ang mga mag-aaral ng iba’t ibang uri ng korespondensiya alinsunod sa mga kumbensiyon sa pagsulat; nakagagawa ng mga propesyonal na profiles at resumés na akma sa layon at awdyens; nakasusulat ng mga case studies, panukalang proyekto, at ulat-pangnegosyo; nakapagmumungkahi ng mga lathalang pantrabaho, publikasyong korporatibo, o artikulo para sa industriya alinsunod sa pagkakakilanlan ng organisasyon; at nakikilahok sa makabuluhang mga panayam, pulong, talakayan, at negosasyon.', 1, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-4:item-2', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 4, null, 'performance', 'Pagsulat ng nakaestrukturang mga résumé, cover letter, at liham-aplikasyon para sa trabaho o iskolarsyip', 2, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-4:item-3', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 4, null, 'performance', 'Pagsulat ng Korespondensiya Opisyal para sa iba’t ibang pangangailangan (hal., liham-pagtatanong, liham-kahilingan, liham-pagtanggi, liham-pag-uulat, liham-pagsubaybay, liham-panawagan, liham-pagpapatunay, liham-pakikiramay, liham-pakikidalamhati, atbp.)', 3, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-4:item-4', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 4, null, 'performance', 'Pagsulat ng panawagan o anunsiyong pampubliko', 4, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-4:item-5', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 4, null, 'performance', 'Pagbuo ng personal na profile (hal. LinkedIn, portfolio, at iba pang plataporma para sa propesyonal na networking )', 5, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-4:item-6', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 4, null, 'performance', 'Pagsasanay para sa interbyu sa trabaho, paglalahad ng ideang pangnegosyo, o pakikipagnetwork', 6, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-4:item-7', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 4, null, 'performance', 'Pagsulat ng mga memo, incident report, o katitikan ng pulong', 7, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-4:item-8', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 4, null, 'performance', 'Pagsulat ng email para sa mga pormal na kahilingan, follow-up, at korespondensiya sa ibang opisina', 8, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-4:item-9', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 4, null, 'performance', 'Pagsasadula ng konsultasyon sa mga kliyente, pagsagot sa tawag ng kliyente, o propesyonal na pagpapakilala', 9, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-4:item-10', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 4, null, 'performance', 'Presentasyong pang-multimedia gamit ang mga propesyonal na app (hal., Canva, Powerpoint, atbp.)', 10, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon:standard:performance:period-4:item-11', 'sshs-grade-11-mabisang-komunikasyon', 4, null, 'performance', 'Pagtugon sa feedback o reklamo ng mga kustomer gamit ang pasalita at pasulat na komunikasyon Nakikinig nang aktibo sa komunikasyong pantrabaho at propesyonal (hal. mga pulong, tawag sa telepono, presentasyon, panuto, atbp.) upang makapagtala ng tumpak at organisadong impormasyon bilang batayan sa pagsasakatuparan ng gawain at sanggunian sa hinaharap Mabisang pakikilahok sa interaktibong komunikasyon sa kontekstong pantrabaho at propesyonal Nakagagamit ng angkop na wika, tono, at estruktura ayon sa awdyens, layon at konteksto sa pagtalakay ng iba’t ibang usaping propesyonal o pantrabaho', 11, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-malikhaing-pagsulat:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-malikhaing-pagsulat', 1, null, 'content', 'Naipamamalas ng mga mag-aaral ang kaalaman at pag-unawa sa iba’t ibang bukal ng idea’t inspirasyon sa pagkatha, gayundin ang batayang kaalaman sa iba’t ibang pangunahing anyo ng malikhaing pagsulat tulad ng tula at maikling kuwento at sa mga elemento ng mga ito.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-malikhaing-pagsulat:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-11-malikhaing-pagsulat', 1, null, 'content', 'Naipamamalas ng mga mag-aaral ang kaalaman at pag-unawa sa proseso ng palihan at sa pagsasaalang-alang sa rebisyon ng isang malikhaing proyekto.', 2, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-malikhaing-pagsulat:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-malikhaing-pagsulat', 1, null, 'performance', 'Nakasusulat ng unang borador ng piniling malikhaing proyekto – maaaring koleksiyon ng pitong tula o isang maikling kuwentong hindi bababa sa 10 pahina.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-malikhaing-pagsulat:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-11-malikhaing-pagsulat', 1, null, 'performance', 'Nakapagsasagawa ng palihan nang may pagsasaalang-alang sa mga puna at mungkahi tungo sa rebisyon ng isang malikhaing proyekto.', 2, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the concepts and principles of Manual Metal Arc Welding Process (MMAW).', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform setting-up welding machine, accessories, jigs and fixtures, stringer and weave bead patterns in carbon steel plates. Joint fit-up in workpiece/weld specimen and inspect visually following the safety precautions.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the concepts and principles of the fillet welding in carbon steel plates in PA (1F), PC (2F), PF (3F) and PE (4F) positions.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform fillet welding procedures in carbon steel plates in PA (1F), PC (2F), PF (3F) and PE (4F) positions, following the safety precautions. Inspect visually and compute the service cost based on job requirements.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the concepts and principles of the groove welding in carbon steel plates in PA (1G), PC (2G), PF (3G) and PE (4G) positions.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform groove welding procedures in carbon steel plates in PA (1G), PC (2G), PF (3G) and PE (4G) positions following the safety precautions. Inspect visually and compute the service cost based on job requirements.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the concepts and principles of groove welding in carbon steel pipes in PA (1G), PC (2G), PH (5G) and H-LO45 (6G) positions.', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-manual-metal-arc-welding', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform groove welding in carbon steel pipes in PA (1G), PC (2G), PH (5G) and H-LO45 (6G) positions following the safety precautions. Inspect visually and compute the service cost based on job requirements.', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of maintaining the safe engineering watch through monitoring and controlling the operation of a main propulsion and auxiliary machineries; the correct water level and steam pressure of the boiler; emergency procedures and emergency equipment in machinery spaces especially in the engine room operation including communication relevant to engine watchkeeping and the safe working practices and use of electrical equipment', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners demonstrate the skills in engine room piping system based on the Maritime industry standard.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of maintaining the correct water level and steam pressure of the boiler, emergency procedures in machinery spaces, operation of emergency equipment, safe engineering watch, communication relevant to engine watchkeeping, monitoring and controlling of an engine room watch, and understanding of the safe working practices and use of electrical equipment.', 1, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners demonstrate the skills in maintaining a safe engineering watch and safe working practices on the different shipboard scenarios.', 1, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the shipboard maintenance and repair.', 1, 15),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform shipboard maintenance and repair.', 1, 15),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of anti-pollution equipment, operation of equipment and machinery, fueling and oil transfer operations, operating procedures of bilge and ballast system transfer operations, and handling of stores', 1, 18),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-engineering-at-the-support-level', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners apply procedure in prevention of pollution, safe operation of equipment and machinery, fueling and oil transfer operations, bilge and ballast operations, and handling of stores', 1, 18),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the principles in shipping industry and safe navigational watch in navigating vessel.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform look-out, handover and relief of the watch in conformity with acceptable practices and procedures.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the procedure in mooring operations and handling of cargo and stores.', 1, 12),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners carry out mooring operations, safe handling of stowage, securing of cargoes, and stores including dangerous, hazardous, and harmful substances and liquids', 1, 12),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the procedure in safe operations of deck equipment and machinery, occupational health and safety precautions, prevention of pollution of the marine environment, and survival crafts and rescue boats.', 1, 13),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners operate deck equipment and machinery, apply occupational health and safety precautions, apply precautions and contribute to the prevention of pollution of the marine environment, and operate survival crafts and rescue boats.', 1, 13),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the procedure in shipboard maintenance and repair.', 1, 17),
  ('sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-marine-transportation-at-the-support-level', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform shipboard maintenance and repair.', 1, 17),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mechatronics:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-mechatronics', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the principles of mechatronics servicing including its fundamentals, installation, and servicing.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mechatronics:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-mechatronics', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform procedures in mechatronic system installation and servicing while ensuring adherence to safety precautions.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mechatronics:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-mechatronics', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the principles of programmable logic controllers, and control logic programming.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-mechatronics:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-mechatronics', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform procedures in programmable logic controller programming and configuring while ensuring adherence to safety precautions.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of principles in motorcycle driving.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform driving procedures in motorcycles employing safety precautions.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the principles in motorcycles/small engine systems.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform procedures in servicing of motorcycle/small engine system following safety precautions.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the principles in servicing electrical system and chassis in motorcycle/small engine repair.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform procedures in electrical system servicing, and chassis servicing in motorcycle/small engine employing safety precautions.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the principles in overhauling and elements of costing for motorcycles/small engine services.', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-motorcycle-and-small-engine-servicing', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform procedures for overhauling motorcycle engines with safety precautions and compute servicing total costs for the motorcycle/small engine services.', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of principles in overview of organic agriculture production, maintenance of farm tools, materials and equipment, establish nursery for organic vegetable production, planting, and harvest and post-harvest handling operation following industry practices.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform maintenance of farm tools, materials and equipment, nursery establishment, planting operation and harvest and post-harvest handling operation following safety precautions.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of principles in producing organic fertilizer and organic concoctions in accordance with industry practices.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform activities in producing organic concoctions and extracts and organic fertilizer in accordance with industry practices.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the principles of raising organic chicken in accordance with industry practices.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform activities in raising organic chicken in accordance with RA 10068 and Philippine National Standards.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding principles in raising organic hogs in accordance with industry practices.', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production:standard:content:period-4:item-2', 'sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding principles in raising organic small ruminants in accordance with industry practices.', 2, 8),
  ('sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform activities in raising organic hogs in accordance with industry practices.', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production:standard:performance:period-4:item-2', 'sshs-grade-11-organic-agriculture-production', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform activities in organic small ruminants in accordance with industry practices.', 2, 8),
  ('sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino', 1, null, 'content', 'Naipamamalas ang mapanuring pag-unawa at pagpapahalaga sa pagkahubog ng kamalayang pangkasaysayan tungo sa pambansang pagkakakilanlan', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino', 1, null, 'performance', 'Nakapagsasagawa ng proyektong nagpapamalas ng kamalayang pangkasaysayan na angkop sa kontekstong lokal', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino', 2, null, 'content', 'Naipamamalas ang masusing pag-unawa sa iba’t ibang anyo ng pakikibaka bilang salik sa pag-usbong ng kamalayang Pilipino', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino', 2, null, 'performance', 'Nakapagpapahayag ng paninindigan (hal. posisyong papel, presentasyon, pahayag, adbokasiya, atbp.) na nagsusuri sa karanasan ng mga Pilipino sa pakikibaka laban sa iba’t ibang anyo ng opresyon', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino', 3, null, 'content', 'Naipamamalas ang kritikal na pagsusuri at pagpapahalaga sa kamalayang panlikás-kayang pag-unlad na tumutugon sa pangangailangang panlipunan', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino', 3, null, 'performance', 'Nakabubuo ng angkop na panukalang proyektong pangkomunidad na tutugon sa pangangailangan ng kinabibilangang lipunan/pamayanan', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino', 4, null, 'content', 'Naipamamalas ang malalim na pagsusuri at pagpapahalaga sa kamalayan sa pagkamamayang Pilipino at global tungo sa pagiging mapanagutan at aktibong mamamayan ng bansa at daigdig', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-pag-aaral-ng-kasaysayan-at-lipunang-pilipino', 4, null, 'performance', 'Nakapagsasagawa ng adbokasiya na nagpapakita ng pagsuporta sa mga kasalukuyang plano ng pag-unlad tungo sa pagtatamo ng kolektibong pangarap ng sambayanang Pilipino', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-philippine-governance-philippine-politics-and-governance:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-philippine-governance-philippine-politics-and-governance', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an in-depth understanding of the concept and principles of politics and governance, including the role of political ideologies, the concepts of state and nation, and the significance of the 1987 Constitution in shaping democratic governance, human rights, and the rule of law in the Philippines and the global context.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-philippine-governance-philippine-politics-and-governance:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-philippine-governance-philippine-politics-and-governance', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners critically analyze real-world political and governance issues by applying key concepts such as power, ideology, the state, and constitutional principles through research-based presentations, debates, or advocacy campaigns that reflect democratic values, human rights, and social justice.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-philippine-governance-philippine-politics-and-governance:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-philippine-governance-philippine-politics-and-governance', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the roles, functions, and powers of the executive, legislative, and judicial branches as well as the local government units (LGUs), the principles of separation of powers and checks and balances, decentralization, and the importance of public accountability as a cornerstone of democratic governance.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-philippine-governance-philippine-politics-and-governance:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-philippine-governance-philippine-politics-and-governance', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners evaluate current issues and propose informed solutions (or public policies) that promote democratic values, good governance, and national development', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-photovoltaic-systems-installation:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-photovoltaic-systems-installation', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the concepts and principles of solar energy system in Photovoltaic (PV) Systems Installation.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-photovoltaic-systems-installation:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-photovoltaic-systems-installation', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform site assessment with safety precautions.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-photovoltaic-systems-installation:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-photovoltaic-systems-installation', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the concepts and principles of solar energy system in Photovoltaic (PV) Systems Installation.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-photovoltaic-systems-installation:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-photovoltaic-systems-installation', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform PV components inspection with safety precautions.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-photovoltaic-systems-installation:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-photovoltaic-systems-installation', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the concepts and principles of Photovoltaic (Solar Energy) Systems Installation.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-photovoltaic-systems-installation:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-photovoltaic-systems-installation', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform photovoltaic (solar energy) systems installation with safety precautions.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-photovoltaic-systems-installation:standard:performance:period-3:item-2', 'sshs-grade-11-photovoltaic-systems-installation', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform commissioning of photovoltaic (solar energy) systems with safety precautions.', 2, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physical-education-1-fitness-and-recreation:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physical-education-1-fitness-and-recreation', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of fitness and exercise to optimize personal health and promote community wellness.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physical-education-1-fitness-and-recreation:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physical-education-1-fitness-and-recreation', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners organize fitness events to optimize personal health, promote community wellness, and pursue an active lifestyle.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physical-education-1-fitness-and-recreation:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physical-education-1-fitness-and-recreation', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of outdoor recreational activities to optimize personal health and promote community wellness.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physical-education-1-fitness-and-recreation:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physical-education-1-fitness-and-recreation', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners organize outdoor recreational events to optimize personal health, promote community wellness, and pursue an active lifestyle.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physical-education-2-sports-and-dance:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physical-education-2-sports-and-dance', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of sports to optimize personal health and promote community wellness.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physical-education-2-sports-and-dance:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physical-education-2-sports-and-dance', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners organize sports events to optimize personal health, promote community wellness, and pursue an active lifestyle.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physical-education-2-sports-and-dance:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physical-education-2-sports-and-dance', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of dance concepts and principles to optimize personal health and promote community wellness.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physical-education-2-sports-and-dance:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physical-education-2-sports-and-dance', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners organize dance events to optimize personal health, promote community wellness, and pursue an active lifestyle', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-1:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-1', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Physics is fundamental to understanding the natural world in a scientific way and leads to the development of many applications that benefit society;', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-1:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-1', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'measuring should be done precisely and accurately, and must be expressed correctly; and', 2, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-1:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-1', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'qualitative, quantitative, and graphical analysis of motion provide complementary ways to understand, describe, and predict motion.', 3, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-1:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-1', 1, null, 'performance', 'By the end of the quarter, learners properly measure and use pertinent units, compute resultant vectors, and analyze motion graphs. They explain, calculate, and analyze one-dimensional, two-dimensional, and relative motion in practical contexts and solve problems using kinematic equations. They also describe and explain how basic physics principles are applied to describe and make predictions about motion in everyday situations and scenarios.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-1:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-1', 2, 'D03', 'content', 'Newton''s Laws of Motion, work, energy, power, and the conservation of energy are essential for understanding the behavior of objects and systems;', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-1:standard:content:period-2:item-2', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-1', 2, 'D03', 'content', 'momentum, impulse, and the laws of conservation are essential in evaluating the efficiency and safety of physical systems;', 2, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-1:standard:content:period-2:item-3', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-1', 2, 'D04', 'content', 'rotational mechanics can maximize efficiency in physical systems; and', 3, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-1:standard:content:period-2:item-4', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-1', 2, null, 'content', 'simple harmonic motion can be characterized by periodic motion.', 4, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-1:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-1', 2, null, 'performance', 'By the end of the quarter, learners properly measure and use pertinent units, compute resultant vectors, and analyze motion graphs. They explain, calculate, and analyze one-dimensional, two-dimensional, and relative motion in practical contexts and solve problems using kinematic equations. They also describe and explain how basic physics principles are applied to describe and make predictions about motion in everyday situations and scenarios.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-2:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-2', 3, 'D01', 'content', 'Newton’s law of universal gravitation can help explain the celestial motion of natural and artificial satellites.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-2:standard:content:period-3:item-2', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-2', 3, 'D02', 'content', 'the properties of fluids are fundamental for understanding fluid behavior and its applications in various systems; and', 2, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-2:standard:content:period-3:item-3', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-2', 3, 'D02', 'content', 'buoyancy has a crucial role in maintaining balance and stability in fluids to ensure safety of aquatic and aerial structures and vehicles.', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-2:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-2', 3, null, 'performance', 'By the end of the quarter, learners describe and explain the physical principles governing gravitational systems and the properties of fluids. They analyze and apply the principles of fluid dynamics to resolve problems in systems and applications. They design and conduct experiments to demonstrate fluid properties and apply fluid mechanics principles to develop practical solutions to real-world problems, showcasing the relevance and impact of fluid behavior in various fields.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-2:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-2', 4, 'D03', 'content', 'concepts of temperature and heat are vital to explain processes in different natural and artificial systems;', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-2:standard:content:period-4:item-2', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-2', 4, 'D03', 'content', 'the concepts of thermal expansion are critical in constructing and designing buildings, bridges, and train rails;', 2, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-2:standard:content:period-4:item-3', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-2', 4, 'D04', 'content', 'quantifying heat transfers in a thermal system is vital in understanding its energy efficiency; and', 3, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-2:standard:content:period-4:item-4', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-2', 4, 'D04', 'content', 'the laws of thermodynamics have a wide range of applications across various fields.', 4, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-physics-2:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-physics-2', 4, null, 'performance', 'By the end of the quarter, learners distinguish the fundamental concepts of temperature and heat and explain the methods of heat transfer using examples. Learners design and conduct simple experiments to demonstrate thermodynamic processes, showcasing the relevance and impact of thermodynamics in various practical applications. They analyze and apply the laws of thermodynamics to solve word problems and explain their real-world applications. They describe and analyze thermodynamic processes in various systems and calculate the efficiency of heat engines and refrigeration systems. They discuss the principles of phase transitions in terms of latent heat and phase and describe the role of thermodynamics in environmental and engineering systems.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding on the overview of poultry production-chicken, pre-operational activities, farm input requirements, and maintenance of farm facilities for poultry production-chicken.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform pre-operational activities and maintenance of farm facilities in poultry production-chicken in accordance with Occupational Safety and Health Standards.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding the principles in poultry breeds and strains in the Philippines and health and care management in poultry production-chicken.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform flock selection and culling, brooding of chicks, and beak trimming in accordance with Animal Welfare Act.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding the principle in growing of broilers and layers, pre-laying and laying activities of ready to lay-pullets, poultry-chicken breeding activities.', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform growing of chicken-broilers and layers and collection of eggs according to enterprise production requirement.', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the principles on harvesting and post-harvesting activities of poultry-chicken based on the industry practices.', 1, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-poultry-production-chicken', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform dressing of chicken, marketing of poultry products, and evaluation of records for production expansion.', 1, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding on the overview, occupational safety and health standards, use and maintenance of the different tools, materials, implements, and equipment, housing, fixtures, and facilities, and forage production raising dairy and meat-type ruminants.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform activities in using and maintaining of different tools, materials, implements, and equipment, farm layout, housing, fixtures and facilities and forage production in raising dairy and meat-type ruminants in following occupational safety and health standards.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the principles in preparation of silage and breeding in raising dairy and meat-type ruminants.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform silage making and breeding in raising dairy and meat-type ruminants in accordance with industry practices.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the principles in feeding and care and management in raising dairy and meat-type ruminants.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform feeding, caring and management in raising dairy and meat-type ruminants in accordance with industry practices.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the principles in management practices, pre-selling activities and marketing in raising dairy and meat-type ruminants.', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ruminants-production', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform activities in management practices, pre-selling activities and marketing of raising dairy and meat-type ruminants in accordance with industry practices.', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate comprehensive knowledge and understanding of the international and national maritime regulatory frameworks, environmental sustainability protocols, cultural diversity, and the organizational structure and operations of shipboard catering services.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners independently demonstrate waste disposal practices in compliance with MARPOL regulations.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of ship provisioning and storage, mess hall operations, pantry and housekeeping management, and sanitation practices onboard vessels.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform food service in various mess hall settings, replenishing pantry items, and carrying out housekeeping procedures in cabins and public areas in accordance with industry standards.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the fundamental principles of victualing (budgeting and consumption management) and galley and catering operations.', 1, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners apply the methods and techniques in preparing menu in accordance with industry standards.', 1, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding on production of bakery and pastry products.', 1, 11),
  ('sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-ships-catering-services', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners prepare and present a range of bread and pastry products in accordance with industry standard.', 1, 11),
  ('sshs-grade-11-social-sciences-theory-and-practice:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-social-sciences-theory-and-practice', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the historical development, key concepts, and approaches in the Social Sciences including its major theories, enabling them to analyze and explain human behavior, social structures, and cultural dynamics within diverse societal', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-social-sciences-theory-and-practice:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-social-sciences-theory-and-practice', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learner applies Social Science disciplines in explaining a social issue using a multimedia presentation, infographic, podcast, or other relevant presentation scheme.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-social-sciences-theory-and-practice:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-social-sciences-theory-and-practice', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the behavioral and the applied social sciences, recognizing the roles of professionals, while grasping the functions and impacts of these disciplines in promoting social change and community well-being.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-social-sciences-theory-and-practice:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-social-sciences-theory-and-practice', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners consult with a professional from an applied social science discipline (e.g., counseling, social work, criminology, education, communication) to gain insights into their roles and contributions to social change, analyze the discipline’s real-world impact, and synthesize findings into a reflective report or presentation, demonstrating effective communication and ethical awareness.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-sports-activity-management:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-sports-activity-management', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the basic principles and concepts of activity management for effective planning and organizing of sports events and activities.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-sports-activity-management:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-sports-activity-management', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners create a comprehensive plan for sports events and activities with advanced management activity skills for implementation.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-sports-activity-management:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-sports-activity-management', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate the ability to organize sports events by combining officiating, coaching, and activity management skills. They evaluate the success of these events by analyzing the contributions of each role.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-sports-activity-management:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-sports-activity-management', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners organize and manage sports events, demonstrating the integration of officiating, coaching, and activity management skills, while evaluating the overall success of each event.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-sports-coaching:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-sports-coaching', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the philosophy, principles, styles, skills, and techniques for future careers and opportunities in coaching or individual/dual sports.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-sports-coaching:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-sports-coaching', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners execute individual/dual sports activities to showcase their skill in sports coaching.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-sports-coaching:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-sports-coaching', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the philosophy, principles, styles, skills, and techniques for future careers and opportunities in coaching for team sports.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-sports-coaching:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-sports-coaching', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners organize team sports activities to showcase their skills in coaching.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-sports-officiating:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-sports-officiating', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the fundamental principles and concepts of sports officiating to ensure the seamless and effective management of games and competition.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-sports-officiating:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-sports-officiating', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners evaluate the sports officiating during simulations, games, and competitions, promoting integrity and self-development.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-sports-officiating:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-sports-officiating', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the fundamental principles and concepts of sports officiating to ensure the seamless and effective management of games and competition.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-sports-officiating:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-sports-officiating', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners assess sports officiating during simulations, games, and competitions, promoting integrity and self-development.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-swine-production:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-swine-production', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of principles in the overview of swine production, Occupational Safety and Health Standards, and tools, materials, and equipment used in swine production according to industry standards.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-swine-production:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-swine-production', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform waste management using tools, materials, and equipment.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-swine-production:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-swine-production', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding in swine housing, breed selection, and breeding management for efficient and sustainable production of industry standards.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-swine-production:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-swine-production', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform breeding management of sows and boars according to industry standard.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-11-swine-production:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-swine-production', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of health and care management practices across the stages of swine production.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-swine-production:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-swine-production', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform health and care management on the different stages of swine production according to industry standards.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-swine-production:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-swine-production', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of Health Management, Record Keeping, Harvesting and post-harvest Management and Marketing in swine production in compliance with industry requirements.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-swine-production:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-swine-production', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners perform health management, harvesting and post harvesting, record keeping and marketing in swine production according to industry standard.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the fundamentals of technical drafting, tools and materials in manual drafting, mensuration and calculation, drafting conventions, architectural symbols, and details in producing architectural plans.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners create accurate technical drawings, and architectural plans observing relevant building codes, standards, and conventions.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of drafting principles, techniques, and industry standards including mastering manual drafting, knowledge of various disciplines (architectural, structural, electrical, plumbing, mechanical).', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners create manual Structural, Electrical, Electronic, and Mechanical plans projects observing relevant building codes, standards, and conventions.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of CAD software installation, interface navigation, creation of 2D and 3D geometries, and produce accurate 2D architectural and structural plans in CAD', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners create 2D and 3D geometries, and detailed 2D architectural and structural plans projects using CAD software observing relevant building codes, standards, and conventions.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding in using Computer-Aided Design (CAD) software to create detailed 2D and 3D drawings of various building systems, and compute project cost estimate align to the industry standards.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-technical-drafting', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners create 2D and 3D Computer-Aided Design (CAD) layouts project integrating Electrical, Electronic, Mechanical plans, Architectural Model and compute project cost estimate observing relevant building codes, standards, and conventions.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-11-tourism-services:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-tourism-services', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners will develop comprehensive travel intermediaries, attractions and activities by proposing well-structured itineraries that showcase the unique offerings of the Philippines at specific destinations.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-tourism-services:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-tourism-services', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learner will design travel intermediaries to promote attractions, tourism, culture and activities of specific places that highlight the Philippines'' unique offerings at specific destinations.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-tourism-services:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-tourism-services', 2, null, 'content', 'The learner understands travel preliminaries, the ticketing process, completing travel service transactions, and crisis management in travel.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-tourism-services:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-tourism-services', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learner demonstrates solutions and alternatives to address a customer’s ticket concerns, integrate the process of ticketing for travel transactions, and performs the procedures for providing compensation entitlements to guests affected by travel disruptions aligned with ASEAN MRA Toolbox.', 1, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-11-tourism-services:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-tourism-services', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners understand the key concepts of tourism promotions, products and services, tour packages, ways of promoting tourism, dealing with customers, and the health, safety, and security of tourism services.', 1, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-tourism-services:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-tourism-services', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners will be able to develop tour packages, appropriately dealing with customers, in performing product marketing using promotional tools and techniques.', 1, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-11-tourism-services:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-tourism-services', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate an understanding of the overview of local guiding services, tour guiding as a profession, tourism in the Philippines, the different stages of tour guiding, tour documents, logbooks, and suppliers, and Risk Management in Tour Guiding.', 1, 16),
  ('sshs-grade-11-tourism-services:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-tourism-services', 4, null, 'performance', 'Learners show the characteristics and roles of a tour guide, the Filipino brand of service excellence, the stages of tour guiding, and the ability to assess risks in tour guiding and implement appropriate procedures for handling unforeseen events.', 1, 16),
  ('sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of fundamental principles and trends of visual graphic design needed in creating logo designs and print media design using appropriate software, tools, and materials based on industry standards.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners create logo designs and print media design using appropriate software, tools, and materials based on industry standards.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design:standard:content:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design', 2, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of user experience designs (UX) and user interface design (UI) using appropriate software, tools, and materials based on industry standards.', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design:standard:performance:period-2:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design', 2, null, 'performance', 'The learners create user experience (UX) design and user interface design (UI) using appropriate software, tools, and materials based on industry standards.', 1, 7),
  ('sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design:standard:content:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design', 3, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the principles in product packaging design using appropriate software, tools, and materials based on industry standards.', 1, 10),
  ('sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design:standard:performance:period-3:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design', 3, null, 'performance', 'The learners create product packaging with design using appropriate software, tools, and materials, with the design pricing / costing guide based on industry standards.', 1, 10),
  ('sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design:standard:content:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design', 4, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of designing and developing a 2D and 3D booth or product window display using appropriate software, tools, materials, and compute design cost based on industry standards.', 1, 12),
  ('sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design:standard:performance:period-4:item-1', 'sshs-grade-11-visual-graphic-design', 4, null, 'performance', 'The learners create 2D and 3D booth and product window/display designs and mock-up for presentations using appropriate software, tools, materials, and compute design cost based on industry standards.', 1, 12),
  ('sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Basic Mathematical Modeling', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Angles and Their Measures', 2, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Trigonometric Functions', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Trigonometric Identities', 4, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Inverse Trigonometric Functions', 5, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics:standard:content:period-1:item-6', 'sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Polar Coordinates*', 6, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can analyze and model real-life situations using linear, quadratic, and exponential functions. They construct, evaluate, and verify these algebraically and graphically, apply function transformations using appropriate technology to represent and interpret solutions, and explain key function behaviors and limitations. The learners can also distinguish among these function types using data, graphs, and context, and evaluate the suitability and reasonableness of models in business, science, and everyday applications. They communicate conclusions using graphs, tables, equations, and written explanations to support sound decision-making. The learners can also model real-life phenomena using angle and radian measures, arc length, area of a sector, and trigonometric functions. They can present scenario analyses and clearly communicate their reasoning through visual and algebraic representations demonstrating how these concepts support problem-solving and informed decision-making in science, technology, and engineering.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-advanced-mathematics', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can use their understanding of trigonometric concepts to analyze, represent, and solve mathematical and real-life situations. They can apply key trigonometric formulas to simplify expressions, justify steps, and construct proofs, and evaluate and interpret trigonometric and inverse trigonometric functions using appropriate strategies. The learners communicate ideas through graphs, equations, tables, and explanations, showing ease in shifting between different representations. When solving contextual problems, they can apply inverse trigonometric functions to generate reasonable solutions and explain their significance. *To extend their mathematical understanding, the learners can use the polar coordinate system to describe and analyze relationships that are not effectively represented in rectangular coordinates. They can locate and convert points, identify and sketch polar curves, and use these tools to model real-world situations accurately. The learners can integrate their understanding of trigonometric identities, inverse functions, and coordinate systems to build meaningful models, explain reasoning effectively, and make informed decisions, demonstrating how abstract mathematical ideas connect to practical applications in science, technology, engineering, and everyday problem-solving.', 2, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-dance:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-dance', 1, null, 'content', 'The learner demonstrates understanding of the roles of dance artists, dance production processes, professional practices, and ethical standards through apprenticeship experiences within dance organizations and creative industry settings.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-dance:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-dance', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can synthesize apprenticeship experiences that reflect dance knowledge, skills, and professional work ethics in the learners’ chosen field through work performance and creative documentation. 1', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-literary-arts:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-literary-arts', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of literary arts production processes, literary genres, professional practices, and ethical standards through apprenticeship experiences within the publishing and print media industry.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-literary-arts:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-literary-arts', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners demonstrate proficiency in literary arts production and analysis through apprenticeship engagement and creative documentation, reflecting artistic, cultural, and ethical practices in literary arts. 1', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-media-arts:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-media-arts', 1, null, 'content', 'The learner demonstrates understanding of media arts production processes, professional practices, ethical standards, and industry engagement through apprenticeship experiences in media arts within creative industry settings.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-media-arts:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-media-arts', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learner demonstrates proficiency and professionalism in media arts production through apprenticeship activities and portfolio documentation, reflecting artistic, cultural, and ethical practices within the media arts industry. 1', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-music:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-music', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the roles of music artists, music production processes, professional practices, and ethical standards through apprenticeship experiences within music organizations and creative industry settings.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-music:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-music', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners synthesize apprenticeship experiences that reflect the learner’s musical knowledge and skills in his/her chosen field, emphasizing work ethic through performance and creative documentation. 1', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-theater-arts:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-theater-arts', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of the roles of theater artists, theater production processes, professional practices, and ethical standards through apprenticeship experiences within theater organizations and creative industry settings.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-theater-arts:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-arts-apprenticeship-theater-arts', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners synthesize their apprenticeship experiences that reflect knowledge and skills in theater arts, emphasizing artistic, educational, cultural values, and work ethics through work performance and creative documentation. 1', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Limits and Continuity', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Derivatives and Tangents', 2, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Rules of Differentiation', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Applications of Derivatives', 4, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Antiderivatives (Indefinite Integrals)', 5, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus:standard:content:period-1:item-6', 'sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Definite Integrals and Area', 6, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can analyze and model real-life and mathematical situations by interpreting graphs to describe the behavior and properties of these functions and applying these insights in demonstrating continuity and limits where appropriate. They can apply their understanding of derivatives to solve problems, illustrate tangent lines, and relate derivatives to slopes. The learners also examine the relationship between continuity and differentiability and compute derivatives of algebraic, exponential, and logarithmic functions using basic differentiation rules, the Chain Rule, and implicit differentiation.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-basic-calculus', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can interpret and solve problems involving derivatives, related rates, and optimization in practical contexts, such as maximizing profit, minimizing cost, or modeling motion. They can also demonstrate their understanding of antiderivatives and integrals by solving real-life and mathematical problems. The learners can illustrate antiderivatives, explain the relationship between derivatives and antiderivatives, and compute antiderivatives of polynomial, radical, and exponential functions. They can apply the substitution rule to compute antiderivatives and solve related problems. The learners can interpret the definite integral as the limit of Riemann sums and apply the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus to evaluate definite integrals. They can solve problems involving areas of plane regions and apply integration in real-world contexts, such as calculating land area, material usage, and accumulated quantities.', 2, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-3:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-3', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'biological macromolecules such as carbohydrates, lipids, proteins, and nucleic acids are essential for cellular functions and metabolism;', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-3:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-3', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'DNA and RNA are nucleic acids that store and transmit genetic information and that their molecular structures determine their biological functions;', 2, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-3:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-3', 1, 'D03', 'content', 'genetic information stored in DNA is expressed through RNA and proteins during the processes of DNA replication, transcription, and translation;', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-3:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-3', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'mutations are changes in genetic material that can alter gene expression and protein structure, resulting in variation and genetic disorders;', 4, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-3:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-3', 1, 'D05', 'content', 'traits are inherited through different genetic patterns that determine the genotype and phenotype of organisms; and', 5, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-3:standard:content:period-1:item-6', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-3', 1, 'D06', 'content', 'changes in chromosome structure or number can influence inheritance and may lead to genetic variation or genetic disorders.', 6, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-3:standard:content:period-1:item-7', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-3', 1, 'D07', 'content', 'recombinant DNA technology allows the modification of genetic material and has applications in medicine, agriculture, and environmental conservation;', 7, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-3:standard:content:period-1:item-8', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-3', 1, 'D08', 'content', 'genetic variation caused by mutation and recombination can lead to evolutionary change in populations;', 8, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-3:standard:content:period-1:item-9', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-3', 1, 'D10', 'content', 'evolution is supported by scientific evidence and is reflected in the history of life on Earth through the geologic time scale;', 9, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-3:standard:content:period-1:item-10', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-3', 1, 'D12', 'content', 'evolutionary processes such as natural selection, genetic drift, mutation, recombination, and speciation explain the emergence of species and the diversity of life on Earth;', 10, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-3:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-3', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can explain how genetic information is stored, expressed, and inherited by describing the roles of biomolecules and genetic structures, constructing models of gene expression, solving genetic cross problems to predict inheritance patterns, and presenting explanations of how mutations and chromosomal changes affect organism traits and genetic disorders.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-3:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-3', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can analyze evidence of evolution and explain how genetic variation and evolutionary processes lead to speciation and biodiversity. They can also communicate the applications of recombinant DNA technology in medicine, agriculture, and environmental conservation through models, reports, or multimedia presentations.', 2, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-4:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-4', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'organisms are classified based on shared structural characteristics and molecular evidence, and that biological classification reflects evolutionary relationships and adaptations of organisms;', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-4:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-4', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'organisms can be identified and classified to support biodiversity conservation and the prioritization of species that are extinct or at risk of extinction;', 2, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-4:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-4', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'organisms interact with one another and with abiotic factors within ecosystems; and', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-4:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-4', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'energy flows through ecosystems and terrestrial and aquatic ecosystems are interconnected, contributing to ecosystem balance.', 4, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-4:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-4', 1, 'D03', 'content', 'human activities and development interventions can positively and negatively impact ecosystems and natural resources;', 5, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-4:standard:content:period-1:item-6', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-4', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'biotechnology and artificial intelligence contribute to improvements in health, food security, and environmental sustainability; and', 6, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-4:standard:content:period-1:item-7', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-4', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'the development and application of technologies such as biotechnology and artificial intelligence (AI) involve ethical considerations and social, legal, and environmental trade-offs.', 7, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-4:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-4', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can classify organisms based on their distinctive characteristics, explain ecological interactions and energy flow within ecosystems, and present evidence-based explanations of how biodiversity conservation and ecosystem interconnections contribute to environmental sustainability.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-biology-4:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-biology-4', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can analyze how human activities and technological developments affect ecosystems and natural resources by explaining nutrient cycles, evaluating environmental impacts of development projects, and presenting informed perspectives on the roles, benefits, and ethical implications of biotechnology and artificial intelligence in addressing environmental and societal challenges.', 2, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'acids and bases found in everyday life and environmental systems play important roles in maintaining chemical balance in natural environments and human activities;', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'different acid-base theories explain the behavior of acids and bases;', 2, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'the pH of solutions describes the concentration of hydrogen ions, and that the strength and concentration of acids and bases determine their behavior in chemical reactions;', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'titration curves provide graphical representations of acid-base reactions;', 4, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, 'D03', 'content', 'buffer systems maintain relatively constant pH in natural, biological, and chemical systems; and', 5, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:content:period-1:item-6', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'chemical systems reach dynamic equilibrium in closed systems and that the extent and direction of reactions can be predicted using equilibrium constants and Le Chatelier’s principle.', 6, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:content:period-1:item-7', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, 'D05', 'content', 'mixtures can be separated based on differences in physical properties using appropriate techniques;', 7, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:content:period-1:item-8', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, 'D06', 'content', 'instrumental analytical techniques use measurable signals such as light absorption to determine the concentration of substances;', 8, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:content:period-1:item-9', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, 'D07', 'content', 'oxidation-reduction reactions involve electron transfer and changes in oxidation numbers;', 9, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:content:period-1:item-10', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, 'D08', 'content', 'electrochemical cells convert chemical energy into electrical energy through redox processes;', 10, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:content:period-1:item-11', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, 'D09', 'content', 'standard electrode potentials and cell potentials can be used to predict the direction and spontaneity of redox reactions;', 11, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:content:period-1:item-12', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, 'D10', 'content', 'electrolysis drives nonspontaneous redox reactions using electrical energy; and', 12, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:content:period-1:item-13', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, 'D11', 'content', 'electrochemical principles are applied in technologies such as batteries, corrosion control, and sustainable energy systems.', 13, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can design and conduct investigations to analyze the properties and behavior of acids, bases, and buffer systems. They interpret pH values and titration curves using mathematical and graphical models and communicate scientific explanations using chemical equations and experimental evidence. The learners can also explain chemical equilibrium and Le Chatelier’s principle, conduct investigations to observe changes in equilibrium systems, and apply these concepts to explain industrial and environmental processes using Green Chemistry principles.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-3', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can explain different separation techniques, interpret colorimetric data to determine concentrations, and conduct investigations using appropriate techniques. The learners can analyze redox reactions and use standard reduction potentials and cell potential values to predict reactivity and spontaneity. They can also explain electrolysis processes and apply electrochemical principles to real-world systems such as batteries, corrosion control, and sustainable energy technologies.', 2, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'carbon has unique bonding properties that enable the formation of a wide variety of organic compounds with diverse structures and functions;', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'bonding, electronegativity, and intermolecular forces determine the structure, polarity, and physical properties of organic compounds;', 2, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, null, 'content', 'electron distribution within molecules influences molecular polarity and stability, which affect physical properties and interactions;', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'how the structures of certain molecules are explained by hybrid orbitals;', 4, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, null, 'content', 'functional groups determine the properties and reactivity of organic compounds;', 5, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:content:period-1:item-6', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, 'D06', 'content', 'hydrocarbons exhibit structural diversity and can be classified based on bonding, which influences their properties and uses; and', 6, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:content:period-1:item-7', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, 'D07', 'content', 'the presence of multiple bonds in hydrocarbons affects structure, reactivity, and applications.', 7, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:content:period-1:item-8', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, 'D09', 'content', 'functional groups influence the structure, properties, and uses of organic compounds;', 8, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:content:period-1:item-9', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, 'D10', 'content', 'aromatic compounds exhibit unique stability due to electron delocalization, which affects their properties and applications;', 9, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:content:period-1:item-10', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, 'D12', 'content', 'carbonyl functional groups affect the physical properties and chemical behavior of organic compounds;', 10, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:content:period-1:item-11', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, null, 'content', 'carboxylic functional groups influence acidity, properties, and reactivity of compounds;', 11, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:content:period-1:item-12', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, 'D15', 'content', 'biomolecules are organic compounds whose structures determine their biological functions; and', 12, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:content:period-1:item-13', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, 'D16', 'content', 'the structure and functional groups of organic compounds determine their applications in various fields.', 13, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can use structural models to represent organic compounds and write their IUPAC names. They can explain how bonding, polarity, and functional groups determine their physical and chemical properties. They can also analyze and compare hydrocarbons based on structure and bonding and apply these concepts to explain the uses of organic compounds such as fuels and industrial materials in relation to their properties and safety considerations.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-chemistry-4', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can use IUPAC nomenclature and structural models to represent organic compounds and explain how functional groups influence their properties and behavior. They can analyze and compare different classes of organic compounds based on their properties, and relate these to their applications in biological, industrial, and environmental contexts. They can also examine the characteristics of biomolecules and discuss their significance in both biological and everyday contexts.', 2, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'traits are passed from parents to offspring through genes, and that variations in DNA result in observable differences among individuals and populations;', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'natural variation in inherited traits contributes to biodiversity, and that endemic organisms play important roles in maintaining ecosystems and supporting community life; and', 2, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space', 1, 'D03', 'content', 'biotechnology, supported by digital tools for analyzing biological information, is applied in everyday life to improve human health, food production, and community well-being.', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'natural resources are essential for daily living and that sustainable practices help reduce environmental impact and ensure resource availability for present and future needs;', 4, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space', 1, 'D05', 'content', 'human activities release pollutants and greenhouse gases that contribute to climate change, which affects ecosystems and communities at local and global levels;', 5, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space:standard:content:period-1:item-6', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space', 1, 'D06', 'content', 'space technologies, including satellites and space probes, provide important data that help scientists understand Earth’s systems, environmental changes, and the universe;', 6, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can design practical and simple solutions or awareness activities that demonstrate understanding of heredity, biodiversity, and biotechnology and their applications in improving everyday life in the community.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-biology-and-earth-and-space', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can design and communicate simple, evidence-based explanations or proposals that demonstrate understanding of environmental sustainability, climate change, and the role of space technologies in monitoring Earth and improving daily life.', 2, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life', 1, null, 'content', ':', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'scientific discoveries in physics and chemistry are shaped by the contributions of scientists and lead to innovations that improve everyday life and create diverse career opportunities in science and technology.', 2, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'principles of motion, including circular and rotational motion, explain the movement of objects and systems and guide the design and safe use of machines, transportation systems, and other technologies in everyday life.', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life', 1, 'D03', 'content', 'aerodynamic principles involving air pressure and airspeed influence the behavior of objects and are applied in the design of vehicles, structures, and technologies to improve efficiency and performance; and', 4, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'light and wave phenomena, including color formation and wave interference, explain observable patterns in nature and are applied in technologies used in communication, engineering, entertainment, and industry.', 5, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life:standard:content:period-1:item-6', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life', 1, 'D05', 'content', 'atomic mass, formula mass, and molecular mass help determine the composition and proper use of substances in daily life such as in nutrition, medicine, and chemical products;', 6, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life:standard:content:period-1:item-7', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life', 1, 'D06', 'content', 'the mole concept is used by scientists to count very small particles and is applied in medicine, environmental monitoring, and industry;', 7, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life:standard:content:period-1:item-8', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life', 1, 'D07', 'content', 'factors such as surface area and temperature affect how fast chemical reactions occur and influence the effectiveness and shelf life of many products;', 8, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life:standard:content:period-1:item-9', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life', 1, 'D08', 'content', 'organic compounds are present in many materials at home and in school and are widely used in consumer products, industry, health, and medicine;', 9, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life:standard:content:period-1:item-10', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life', 1, 'D09', 'content', 'some organic compounds can affect the environment and contribute to issues such as air pollution and climate change; and', 10, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life:standard:content:period-1:item-11', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life', 1, 'D10', 'content', 'changes in pressure, volume, and temperature affect gases and explain many everyday applications and technologies.', 11, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can apply key concepts of motion, aerodynamics, light, and wave behavior to explain everyday phenomena and technological innovations. They can analyze how scientific discoveries and careers in Physics contribute to societal development and demonstrate how these principles are applied in real-life technologies and industries.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-conceptual-physics-and-chemistry-in-daily-life', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can explain how basic chemistry concepts such as particle measurement, reaction rates, organic compounds, and gas relationships are applied in everyday life. They can describe simple examples of these concepts in household products, environmental issues, and common technologies.', 2, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-creative-production-and-presentation:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-creative-production-and-presentation', 1, null, 'content', 'The learners demonstrate understanding of creative production processes, artistic documentation methods, and project management in developing and presenting discipline-specific creative works.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-creative-production-and-presentation:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-creative-production-and-presentation', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can apply practical skills through supervised hands-on activities that promote skill development, personal growth, and preparation for future career opportunities.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-database-management:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-database-management', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'databases and database management systems store, organize, and manage data efficiently, and that relational and nonrelational models serve different purposes in real-world applications across various industries.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-database-management:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-database-management', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'Structured Query Language (SQL) is an essential tool for creating, managing, and manipulating data in databases, and that SQL concepts such as tables, rows, columns, syntax structures, and data types support the effective organization and processing of information.', 2, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-database-management:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-database-management', 1, 'D03', 'content', 'SQL commands enable data to be queried, modified, aggregated, grouped, filtered, and combined across tables, allowing meaningful information to be retrieved from databases through well-structured executable queries.', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-database-management:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-database-management', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'the basic concepts of databases and SQL, including queries, functions, and commands, enable effective database management and manipulation.', 4, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-database-management:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-database-management', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners utilize basic database concepts, SQL functions, and SQL commands to perform database management tasks.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-database-management:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-database-management', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners use basic database concepts, SQL functions, and SQL commands to design simple databases.', 2, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'observational evidence such as galaxy recession rates, cosmic microwave background radiation, and the large-scale distribution of matter provides scientific support for models explaining the origin and evolution of the universe;', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'stars have measurable properties and life cycles that can be studied through spectral analysis and classification, and that planetary motions follow predictable patterns governed by gravitational laws;', 2, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3', 1, 'D03', 'content', 'various observational techniques enable the detection of planets beyond the solar system and provide evidence that helps scientists evaluate the possibility of life in other planetary systems;', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'advances in space exploration technologies enhance our understanding of Earth and other planets; and', 4, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'satellite technology and remote sensing enable scientists and government agencies to observe Earth systems, monitor environmental changes, and support disaster risk reduction and environmental management.', 5, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3:standard:content:period-1:item-6', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3', 1, 'D05', 'content', 'satellite observations and remote sensing technologies provide critical data used to monitor Earth''s climate system and environmental changes;', 6, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3:standard:content:period-1:item-7', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3', 1, 'D06', 'content', 'climate change results from natural processes and human activities that alter the balance of energy in Earth''s climate system;', 7, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3:standard:content:period-1:item-8', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3', 1, 'D07', 'content', 'international agreements and national policies guide efforts to mitigate climate change and support adaptation strategies; and', 8, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3:standard:content:period-1:item-9', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3', 1, 'D08', 'content', 'climate mitigation and adaptation strategies can strengthen community resilience and reduce the impacts of climate change.', 9, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can analyze observational and satellite data to explain models of the universe, classify stars and planetary systems, and evaluate evidence related to the existence of exoplanets and extraterrestrial life. They can apply scientific reasoning and digital tools to interpret astronomical and Earth observation data and communicate how space science and remote sensing technologies contribute to environmental monitoring and disaster risk management in the Philippines.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-3', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can analyze satellite and climate datasets to explain climate change trends and their impacts on the Philippines. They can apply scientific reasoning and data analysis to evaluate climate mitigation and adaptation strategies and communicate evidence-based recommendations for strengthening community climate resilience and sustainability.', 2, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'natural hazards originate from geological and hydrometeorological processes and may become disasters depending on the exposure, vulnerability, and capacity of communities;', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4', 1, 'D03', 'content', 'hazard maps and geospatial information are important tools for identifying areas at risk and supporting disaster risk assessment;', 2, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'structural and nature-based mitigation strategies can reduce disaster risks and lessen the impacts of hazards on communities; and', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4', 1, 'D05', 'content', 'disaster risk reduction policies and community preparedness plans help strengthen resilience and reduce disaster impacts.', 4, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4', 1, 'D06', 'content', 'energy production and consumption influence environmental sustainability, and that the transition to renewable energy sources can help reduce environmental impacts and support sustainable development;', 5, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4:standard:content:period-1:item-6', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4', 1, 'D07', 'content', 'human activities such as excessive groundwater extraction can cause land subsidence and increase risks to communities and infrastructure;', 6, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4:standard:content:period-1:item-7', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4', 1, 'D08', 'content', 'geological conditions and human land-use practices influence slope stability, and appropriate geotechnical interventions can reduce landslide risks; and', 7, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4:standard:content:period-1:item-8', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4', 1, 'D09', 'content', 'sustainable energy systems, responsible land use, and resilient infrastructure contribute to disaster-resilient and sustainable communities.', 8, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can analyze hazard maps, disaster records, and risk data to assess disaster risks in local communities. They can evaluate disaster risk reduction strategies and policies and propose evidence-based recommendations that strengthen community preparedness, resilience, and disaster risk management.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-earth-and-space-science-4', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can analyze energy, land-use, and geotechnical data to evaluate environmental risks and sustainability challenges affecting communities in the Philippines. They can assess renewable energy options, investigate land stability issues, and propose evidence-based strategies for developing sustainable and disaster-resilient communities.', 2, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'maintaining sustainable, efficient, and secure computer systems, emphasizing Green ICT principles, effective hardware and software maintenance, system optimization, data management, and cybersecurity measures.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies', 1, 'D06', 'content', 'advanced features and functionalities of digital productivity tools, including word processing, spreadsheets, and presentation software, in creating complex, dynamic, and accessible content for effective', 2, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies', 1, 'D07', 'content', 'communication, collaboration, and problem-solving.', 3, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies', 1, 'D10', 'content', 'Artificial Intelligence (AI), Blockchain, IoT, and No-Code AI Development to foster data literacy, ethical awareness, and critical thinking.', 4, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies', 1, 'D18', 'content', 'No-Code web development to foster practical application skills for real-world innovation and future career opportunities.', 5, 13),
  ('sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners apply sustainable and efficient ICT practices in maintaining, optimizing, and securing computer systems to minimize environmental impact, ensure data integrity, and enhance system performance through proactive hardware and software management.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners create documents and other digital outputs using advanced features and functionalities of digital productivity tools for effective communication, collaboration, and problem solving.', 2, 9),
  ('sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies:standard:performance:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners develop AI-driven models and applications while adhering to ethical guidelines and best practices.', 3, 12),
  ('sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies:standard:performance:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-empowerment-technologies', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners develop functional websites using no-code development tools.', 4, 14),
  ('sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'data analytics involves understanding different types of data, the stages of the data life cycle, and the various types of data analysis that support informed and evidence-based decisions.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'data privacy and ethical principles guide the responsible collection, handling, and analysis of data, ensuring that individuals’ rights are protected and that analytics practices adhere to legal and moral standards.', 2, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics', 1, 'D03', 'content', 'data analytics is widely applied across real-world contexts and industries, and that the field requires specific skills and offers diverse career opportunities.', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'data can come from various internal and external sources, and that appropriate collection methods, such as using public data sets, scripts, and manual entry, are essential for obtaining reliable and relevant information.', 4, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics', 1, 'D05', 'content', 'effective data processing requires securing data through backups, detecting and addressing missing or inconsistent entries, converting data formats accurately based on given requirements, and refining datasets using tools such as filters and pivot tables to prepare information for deeper analysis.', 5, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics:standard:content:period-1:item-6', 'sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics', 1, null, 'content', 'descriptive and inferential statistics are essential tools for understanding, summarizing, and analyzing data, and that spreadsheets or statistical software enable them to compute measures, perform tests, and draw meaningful conclusions from datasets.', 6, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics:standard:content:period-1:item-7', 'sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics', 1, null, 'content', 'conditional and lookup functions enable efficient data analysis, retrieval, and processing, and that combining these functions supports more complex and dynamic data analysis tasks.', 7, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics:standard:content:period-1:item-8', 'sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'data visualization enhances the interpretation and communication of information, and that spreadsheets provide tools such as charts, conditional formatting, tables, pivot tables, and slicers for creating clear and effective visual representations of data.', 8, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics:standard:content:period-1:item-9', 'sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'data visualization software enables the creation of interactive dashboards by importing data, selecting appropriate visual elements, and applying functions such as sorting, filtering, and drilldown to explore insights dynamically.', 9, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics:standard:content:period-1:item-10', 'sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'data storytelling is a powerful method of communicating insights by combining visuals, context, and narrative to help audiences understand and act on data.', 10, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics:standard:content:period-1:item-11', 'sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics', 1, 'D06', 'content', 'a data analytics project requires planning, designing, analyzing, and presenting real-world data to apply statistical methods, visualization tools, and ethical considerations in solving practical problems.', 11, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can illustrate data life cycle and uphold data privacy and ethical principles. They process data accurately and securely by creating backups, cleaning datasets to address missing or inconsistent entries, converting data formats based on specified requirements, and using spreadsheet tools such as filters and pivot tables to refine datasets and generate meaningful insights for decision-making.', 1, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-fundamentals-of-data-analytics', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can perform statistical analyses, apply conditional and lookup functions, create visualizations using spreadsheets and data visualization software, communicate insights through data storytelling, and design and present a complete data analytics project using real-world data.', 2, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-3:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-3', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'the study of electrostatics is essential in explaining the electrical nature of matter; and', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-3:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-3', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'the relationships among electrical quantities, such as electric potential difference (voltage), current, and resistance are important in maintaining efficient and safe electrical systems;', 2, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-3:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-3', 1, 'D03', 'content', 'magnetism is a property of certain materials arising from the alignment of atomic magnetic domains, and that natural magnetic phenomena such as Earth''s magnetic field influence navigation and living organisms;', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-3:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-3', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'a moving electric charge changes the characteristics of the space around it by establishing a magnetic field in addition to its electric field, enabling moving charges to interact through magnetic forces; and', 4, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-3:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-3', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'the study of electromagnetism explains the relationship between electric and magnetic fields, electromagnetic induction, and the technologies that make modern life possible.', 5, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-3:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-3', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can demonstrate their understanding of the principles of electrostatics and current electricity by using theoretical and experimental approaches to solve context-rich problems and situations involving these branches of Physics.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-3:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-3', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can explain the principles of electromagnetism through theoretical and experimental approaches and can recognize their significance in electrical devices.', 2, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-4:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-4', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'the nature and behavior of sound and light waves have diverse applications in various fields such as acoustics, communication technology, medicine, optics, and entertainment.', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-4:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-4', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'competing forces within the nucleus produce stable and unstable energy configurations;', 2, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-4:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-4', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'unstable nuclei become more stable through nuclear transformations;', 3, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-4:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-4', 1, 'D03', 'content', 'ionizing radiation has both beneficial and harmful effects, making radiation safety and protection essential;', 4, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-4:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-4', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'energy stored within mass of objects can be converted into other forms of energy and vice versa; and', 5, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-4:standard:content:period-1:item-6', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-4', 1, 'D04', 'content', 'radiation is a form of energy transmitted by rays or beams of particles.', 6, 5),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-4:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-4', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can explain the properties and behaviors of mechanical and electromagnetic waves through theoretical analysis and contextual problem solving, as well as wave phenomena and their applications in sound, light, communication, and imaging technologies.', 1, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-physics-4:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-physics-4', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can explain the principles of atomic and nuclear physics through theoretical analysis and contextual problem solving and can recognize their applications and implications for nuclear energy and radiation safety.', 2, 6),
  ('sshs-grade-12-pre-calculus:standard:content:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-pre-calculus', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Lines and Circles', 1, 2),
  ('sshs-grade-12-pre-calculus:standard:content:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-pre-calculus', 1, 'D01', 'content', 'Graph Transformations', 2, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-pre-calculus:standard:content:period-1:item-3', 'sshs-grade-12-pre-calculus', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'Polynomial Functions', 3, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-pre-calculus:standard:content:period-1:item-4', 'sshs-grade-12-pre-calculus', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'Rational Functions', 4, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-pre-calculus:standard:content:period-1:item-5', 'sshs-grade-12-pre-calculus', 1, 'D02', 'content', 'Exponential and Logarithmic Functions', 5, 4),
  ('sshs-grade-12-pre-calculus:standard:performance:period-1:item-1', 'sshs-grade-12-pre-calculus', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can investigate and model real-life situations using graphs of equations, and polynomial and rational functions. They can determine equations of lines and circles from geometric conditions, represent real-life situations using these equations, and analyze geometric relationships both algebraically and graphically. The learners can apply basic graph transformations, such as translations and reflections, to show and explain how changes in variables affect the movement, orientation, and overall behavior of graphs. They can also graph solution sets of systems and solve line-circle systems accurately. The learners can select appropriate function types for given contexts, define variables clearly, and state assumptions and constraints. They can represent these functions using equations, tables, and graphs, with appropriate use of technology, and analyze key features such as domain and range, intercepts, asymptotes, and points of intersection. The learners can solve polynomial equations using suitable algebraic methods such as Remainder and Factor Theorems, synthetic division and long division, and interpret these solutions in context. They can evaluate the reasonableness of results by checking against constraints, units, and graphs, and by comparing alternate approaches.', 1, 3),
  ('sshs-grade-12-pre-calculus:standard:performance:period-1:item-2', 'sshs-grade-12-pre-calculus', 1, null, 'performance', 'The learners can conduct an in-depth analysis of real-life situations involving rational, exponential, and logarithmic functions, such as resource optimization, electrical resistance, cooling rates, loan interests, and population growth. They can represent these relationships using appropriate models and provide justified solutions and interpretations. The learners can also define inverses of one-to-one functions, construct and interpret the inverse of an exponential function using logarithms and vice-versa, and sketch and analyze their graphs with correct domains and ranges. Furthermore, they can prove and apply the properties of logarithms to solve related equations and interpret key parameters in real-life contexts, including growth and decay, half-life, and doubling time. Using appropriate technology, they can investigate how changes in parameters can affect graph behavior and analyze connections between algebraic expressions and their graphical representations. Through these experiences, they can demonstrate the ability to connect abstract mathematical concepts to practical applications in areas such as growth and decay, signal processing, design, navigations, and optimization, while strengthening critical thinking, problem-solving, and readiness for advanced study and real-world challenges.', 2, 5);
insert into public.curriculum_standards (
